    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d974">

                <pb facs="0860" n="744" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg744"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/3226.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-14T11:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 14, 1912—11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Following telegram from Consul Alger at Mazatlan: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#right">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 13—11 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >a.m.</hi>
                        </p>
                        <p>Americans, also Mexicans, arriving; some barely escaped death. Many
                            robbed and quite destitute. Government powerless except in cities;
                            entire southern district invaded by bandits. War vessel Mazatlan would
                            relieve the situation and be welcomed by all nationalities, including
                            Mexicans.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Will Department please telegraph me or Consul Alger its decision?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
